SUMMARY:Inner Child Playshop
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nYou're invited to the best play date of t
 he year.\nWho's inviting you? Your inner child. And they want you to know\
 ; it's been too long since the two of you spent time together doing things
  that bring you joy and wonder.\n\nSenseful Wellness is pairing up with Ay
 la Claypool for an afternoon that is equal parts intentional and delightfu
 lly unserious. A three-hour hang designed for the part of you that still k
 nows how to play.\n\nAyla will guide everyone through a series of games us
 ing techniques from physical theatre theorist Jacques Lecoq in order to op
 en our spacial and emotional awareness and take steps toward transformatio
 n. Exploratory and silly\, serious play asks everyone the question of what
  does it mean to move like a kid again. To find the joy.\n\nVi will open a
 nd close the Playshop calling in your inner child and creating the contain
 er for them to actually show up and stay a while.\n\nJenn will move everyo
 ne through an Inner Child Vinyasa Flow\, designed for all bodies and all a
 ges.\nTogether we have created an afternoon that gives your inner child pe
 rmission to flourish\, and reminds everyone that we are all still big kids
  at heart.\n\nCome play with us.
