SUMMARY:Join us for a Spirited Improv Playshop
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**What if one evening could remind you wh
 at it feels like to be fully human\, together?**\n\n**What is Spirited Imp
 rov Playshop?**\n\nA 2-hour playshop of movement\, music\, story\, and uns
 cripted connection. No script\, no performance pressure\, no experience ne
 eded. Just a circle of people willing to show up\, play\, and see what unf
 olds when a room lets go of the need to get it right.\n\n**Who it's for**\
 nPeople craving real connection\, creative expression\, and a little more 
 Love in their lives. If you're drawn to personal growth\, spiritual commun
 ity\, or simply want an evening that feels different from the ones that ca
 me before it\, this is for you.\n\n**Led by**\nJessica Chilton\, an expres
 sive arts practitioner and TEDx performer with twenty years in improvisati
 onal performing arts. She holds space with warmth and a deep trust in what
 ever wants to emerge in the room.\n\nWhat people are saying\n"It's like fr
 ee-falling into the unknown\, but with a big\, warm\, and fluffy safety ne
 t that hugs you when you land."\n\n"We're just taking off all our stuff an
 d walking out in our essence."\n\nCome see for yourself.\n\nRegister at sp
 iritedimprov.com for $40.
